# ── Inbox staging: transient drop zone, never committed ──────────────
# The assistant drops raw files here; Claude files them into the tracked
# inputs/ tree (playbook 00). Only the README is kept under version control.
inputs/_inbox/*
!inputs/_inbox/_README.md

# ── OS / editor cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# ── Loom / voice transcripts: NEVER commit ───────────────────────────
# System rule: transcripts are session-only and are never persisted to disk.
# These patterns are a safety net in case one is ever saved by accident.
**/transcripts/
*loom*transcript*
*_transcript.txt
*_transcript.md

# ── Privacy upgrade path (currently OFF — you chose to commit everything) ──
# If this repo ever becomes public, or you want to reuse the engine as a
# clean template for another student, uncomment the lines below to keep
# personal materials and progress OUT of git (engine-only):
#
#   inputs/
#   gaps/
#   CSC/
#   Maths/
#   GP/
#   Chemistry/
#   Biology/
#
# (The engine = system/, CLAUDE.md, README.md, SYSTEM_MAP.md, .gitignore.)
